        <item><widget class="QLineEdit" name="artworkDirLineEdit"><property name="maximumWidth"><number>320</number></property><property name="toolTip"><string>Single root folder for all of this collection's scraped + manual media. Scraping auto-creates per-type subfolders (box/, screenshot/, marquee/, fanart/, logo/, title/, video/, manual/, …) under it as needed — you don't need to define separate folders for each kind.</string></property></widget></item>
